[
{"segs": ["PA_ja_279:0.1"], "en": "Jātaka:", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_279:0.2", "PA_ja_279:0.3"], "en": "The Collection of Threes, Chapter on the Well (Udapānavagga)", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_279:0.4"], "en": "9. The Satapatta Jātaka:", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_279:1.1", "PA_ja_279:1.2"], "en": "\"Just as a young brahmin on the road [saw] a jackal roaming the forest...\"", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_279:1.3"], "en": "One who desires his welfare proclaims it,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_279:1.4"], "en": "yet he perceives him as one who desires his harm;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_279:1.5"], "en": "while the hundred-petaled one desires his harm—", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_279:1.6"], "en": "\"He thinks, 'He desires my welfare.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_279:2.1", "PA_ja_279:2.2"], "en": "Just so, there is here a certain person who is like that.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_279:2.3"], "en": "When spoken to with beneficial words,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_279:2.4"], "en": "he receives them with hostility;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_279:3.1"], "en": "yet those who praise him—", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_279:3.2"], "en": "Or they exalt him out of fear;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_279:3.3"], "en": "for he considers that man a friend,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_279:3.4"], "en": "just as the young brahmin did the hundred-petaled lotus.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_279:4.1"], "en": "The Satapatta Jātaka, the ninth.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"}
]
